  "material_conclusion": "Non-decreasing final-day Binance USD-M BTC contract open interest was not a useful confirmation gate for the frozen DRA parent. The filter removed 29 Design and 38 Validation signals, lost 24.58948379 and 15.14706547 USDT of total PnL respectively, worsened Design drawdown by 4.806936 percentage points, and produced negative total-PnL deltas in all four annual folds. Validation drawdown and terminal inventory improved only because the filter participated less and removed the remaining open lot; that cleanup did not offset the 18.35526668 USDT realized-PnL loss.",
